Proof of MLflow Model Serving (port 5700)

Serving model MLflow dijalankan pada port 5700 dengan perintah:

python -m uvicorn --host 127.0.0.1 --port 5700 mlflow.pyfunc.scoring_server.app:app

Model endpoint akan tersedia di: http://127.0.0.1:5700

Contoh verifikasi:

curl -I http://127.0.0.1:5700
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:5700/invocations -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"dataframe_split\": {\"columns\": [\"Year\"], \"data\": [[2026]]}}"

